  "prefLabel": "Res 7301.05 Protection of Natural Features and Property",
  "priorExpiration": "2005-01-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 7301.05 Protection of Natural Features and Property. No person shall remove, damage, deface, disturb or alter any structure, plant, marine or freshwater aquatic life with the exception of lawful fishing, natural or geological feature or property on DRED properties. No person shall introduce, abandon or leave any plant, aquatic or terrestrial life, or other foreign object or item on DRED properties without the prior written permission of the director.\n\nSource. #6167 eff 1-18-96, EXPIRED: 1-18-04\n\nNew. #8127, INTERIM, eff 7-27-04, EXPIRED: 1-23-05\n\nNew. #8532, eff 1-1-06 (from Res 7301.03); ss by #10532, eff 3-1-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res7300.html"
